  "selection": "Six healthy leaf cells in the first two rows; no concept pixels. Opacity controls the true silhouette including scanned holes. NormalGL uses matching atlas UVs and tangent-space convention. Displacement is not used: macro blade curvature is authored shallow geometry and scan relief comes from NormalGL. Scattering is not used: no emission or lighting changes.",
